Thu Nov 26 08:06:30 UTC 2026 - Priyanka Saggu <priyanka.saggu@suse.com>

- Update to version 1.37.3:
  * [release-1.37] Update build images to Go 1.26.11
  * [release-1.37] upgrade .go-version to 1.26.11
  * Fix TestEventSeries flaky only focus on testPod namespace
  * Fix code that can cause crash for KCM and kubelet for vsphere volumes
  * apiserver: let net/http pool the HTTP/2 test connections
  * certificates: build the empty DNSName test certificate by hand
  * Improve webhook client config IP matching, encoded handling
  * scheduler: split Pod update with a changed UID into delete and add
  * component-base/metrics: populate DefBuckets when Buckets is empty and NativeHistograms is enabled
  * Update cmd/kube-proxy/app/server.go
  * kube-proxy: avoid missing initial topology update
  * Refresh cached Node UID when creating or verifying CSINode ownership
  * kubeadm: i observe before, `upgrade plan` crashed. Now it shows an error.
  * kubeadm: the missing CA hint shows again
  * apiserver: deflake TestTimeTravelHealthcheck
  * Dereference pointer args passed to %d in Errorf/Fatalf calls
  * gen: avoid empty trailing comment lines in applyconfiguration (Go 1.27 prep)
  * lint: drop ineffective canonical import comments (Go 1.27 prep)
  * gofmt: fix to pass with go1.27 (Go 1.27 prep)
  * vet: go fix -inline (Go 1.27 prep)
  * vet: Fix BackoffError wrapping (Go 1.27 prep)
  * kubeadm: fix etcd data rollback and retry the etcd backup
  * kubeadm: retry etcd member listing on transient errors
  * Validate labels and annotations in pods/binding
  * kubelet: Reject subordinate ID ranges ending at or past 2^32-1
  * kubelet: Don't allocate the 2^32-1 user to a pod
  * kubelet: Properly handle missing getsubids executable
  * fix: extend csrf filter for kubectl proxy

- Update .spec file to bump go version build requirements:
  * `BuildRequires:  go >= 1.26.11`
  * ref: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/blob/v1.37.3/.go-version

